   "x": 804,
   "y": 260,
   "width": 490,
   "height": 49,
   "strokeColor": "#374151",
   "text": "Walmart fines suppliers 3% of the cost of goods on\ncases not delivered on time and in full. Worked\nexample: a $100,000 order delivered late = $3,000.",
